  "title": "Silencing with NOLINT",
  "summary": "`NOLINT` comments silence findings on their line, and compiler warnings too",
  "prose": "`// NOLINT` silences its own line and `// NOLINTNEXTLINE` the next, for every check or the ones named in parentheses. While clang-tidy runs on the file, they silence compiler warnings on those lines as well.",
